($bright$asthma-sim$bright$, $bright$en$bright$, $bright$Severe asthma attack, simulation [needs medical review]$bright$, $bright$SIMULATION, NEEDS MEDICAL REVIEW. A young woman with known asthma arrives breathless and wheezing, speaking in short phrases, with a reliever inhaler that has stopped helping.$bright$,
 $bright$[{"id":"SA-ASSESS","text":"Assesses airway and breathing early and recognises a severe attack (wheeze, work of breathing, ability to speak, saturation)","points":2,"tags":["airway","breathing","assessment"]},{"id":"SA-HISTORY","text":"Takes a focused history (triggers, usual medicines, previous severe attacks) without delaying treatment","points":1,"tags":["assessment","communication"]},{"id":"SA-HELP","text":"Calls for help early","points":1,"tags":["escalation","communication"]},{"id":"SA-MONITOR","text":"Attaches monitoring (saturation, heart rate, blood pressure)","points":1,"tags":["assessment"]},{"id":"SA-OXYGEN","text":"Gives supplemental oxygen to treat low saturation","points":2,"tags":["breathing"]},{"id":"SA-BRONCHO","text":"Gives a first-line inhaled bronchodilator promptly and repeats it if the response is poor (dose and delivery per the locally approved protocol)","points":3,"tags":["medication","breathing"]},{"id":"SA-STEROID","text":"Gives a systemic steroid","points":1,"tags":["medication"]},{"id":"SA-REASSESS","text":"Reassesses the response to treatment and recognises warning signs of tiring or a silent chest","points":1,"tags":["assessment","safety"]},{"id":"SA-ESCALATE","text":"Escalates to a senior clinician or critical care when the attack is severe or not responding","points":2,"tags":["escalation"]},{"id":"SA-COMMS","text":"Reassures the patient and communicates clearly with the team","points":1,"tags":["communication"]}]$bright$::jsonb,
